+*   **Zero Denominator:** If two control points have the same position, weight $w$ is undefined; treat as clamped [S7, unofficial].
+*   **Bin Misalignment:** Using different binning strategies for color and alpha (e.g., center vs. edge) causes slight misalignment at boundaries [S7, unofficial].
